{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_122_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_122_1000_025roc", "source_sha256": "8b1a6e19d8cab5c399505ca7fcac522e516564650650c0d7f495785b53b604de", "ja": "エミリー、さっき\n本を読んでいましたよね。\nあれは、何の本ですか？", "zh": "艾米莉，你刚才在看书吧。\n那是什么书呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_122_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_122_1001_032emi", "source_sha256": "e3d8d3eb8febd6276b30196f77ffb4f50b3d072a4a8b1546cb8dd2fcb52ad3de", "ja": "日本の絶景写真集ですよ、\nロコさん！　学校の図書室で\n借りてきたんです。", "zh": "是日本绝景写真集哦，ROCO先生！我从学校图书室借来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_122_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_122_1002_032emi", "source_sha256": "a484f22f8b54f612d1db7102c5bdc3494d5df4be684d38c2922e1e474083987d", "ja": "最近、お昼休みは\n級友のみなさんと、図書室へ\n通うのが日課になっていて……。", "zh": "最近，午休时间和同学们一起去图书室，已经成了我的日常习惯……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_122_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_122_1003_011ami", "source_sha256": "0edbedda56d4234862e040a55ce547e47f51d9348dc0d3478740316fc153dde3", "ja": "へぇ～、そうなんだ！\n亜美、昼休みはいっつも\n友達と喋ってばっかだな～。", "zh": "这样啊～原来是这么回事！\n亚美午休时总是在和朋友聊天呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_122_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_122_1004_011ami", "source_sha256": "d19d4e2b94cc404819641552077316fe7ba1d395277cfe60fcb3c95b96572e66", "ja": "ねえ、ロコロコ！\nロコロコは、お昼休み\nいつも何してるの？", "zh": "喂，ROCOROCO！\nROCOROCO午休时总是在做什么呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
